/square4Pre-plan the job;
/square4Determine the weight of the walls;
/square4Conduct “pre-lift” meetings to discuss the
safest methods for raising these walls;
/square4Use a competent person to consider and
supervise all aspects of the lifting operation;
/square4Use cranes with appropriate and approved
attachments to assist in raising and placing
balloon framed walls;
Example of carpenters manually raising a balloon framed wall
with a chimney chase attached.  As the photo depicts, more
than 10 workers are exposed to being struck by the wall if it
collapses onto them.
